Z||000001||Old Lar||04-15-2000||03:03 PM||||It's a two wired silvery canister about the size of a Bic lighter to the right of the EGR valve attached to the engine block.<P>Rodney Dickman has replacements, Associated Auto has original styled replaacements.<P>I don't know what it is, but when it goes your tach gets jumpy.||||reg||1
